{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Knight was yanked out of bed and hurled into the craziest beat 'em up adventure! Help him complete his quest and get back home. Slash through hordes of enemies, <strong>defeat bosses</strong>, and take their <strong>unique weapons</strong> with special effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">At your disposal:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ weapon types</strong> with 4 rarity tiers (Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary). Starting with Rare, weapons gain <strong>unique passive effects!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>5+ combat skills</strong>, some usable both on the ground and mid-air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialogue choices\u00a0</strong>\u2014 talk to characters who\u2019ll reveal the world\u2019s secrets. Choose wisely: your decisions shape relationships and <strong>alter the story\u2019s course!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3260760?t=1749510867","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3260760?t=1749510867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260760/2de64858403c5a274fd67ca9b804a201b1a70553/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749510867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260760/2de64858403c5a274fd67ca9b804a201b1a70553/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749510867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Knight was yanked out of bed and hurled into the c